 on though the next thing that I wanted  to do is get a pirate ship in which is  just a thing that I wanted to do because  it looks very fancy and it's always nice  to have one of these things beside the  lake it's a very picturesque kind of  thing and it's really one of those safe  ways to do certain things if you want to  have a flat ride that looks cool just  make a pirate ship put it next to a lake  have a bunch of rocks and foliage maybe  a building next to it and it's bound to  look good so that's what I'm going for  here and I had this cue a thing already  copied from two other rights that I made  earlier so there is a lot of copying  things to save time here but I did want  to add a specific touch to it every time  and in this case I wanted to add a tower  next to the pirate ship which turned out  to be a bit more annoying than I figured  beforehand since the pirate ship is  something that I completely forgot about  here and it is almost going to hit the  tower so I had to do a bit of building  gymnastics to make sure that the tower  would just stay lower than the pirate  ship when it swings but it's right about  in the safe zone so I'm quite happy with  how the tower works out on the side  there and just to get rid of that very  mechanical looking orange color of the  base of the ride I wanted to have a  bunch of rock work underneath it and  I'll put some foliage in there as well  to spruce it up a bit and make it look a  bit more finished but this is like one  of the last big things that I still did  in the park now almost at the end some  of the finishing touches is and in  details and over here you can already  kind of see what the park is looking  like in it's almost finished stage  these are really the final touches of  foliage and scenery around all of all of  the parts that I have and this is more  or less what it turned into I want to  end this video with a couple of  cinematic shots to just give you another  idea of what the park looks like in the  end and yeah that is just about it for  today thank you guys so much for  watching and I hope to see you guys next  time in which hopefully I'll be back to  fantasy valley or some kind of other  projects see you guys  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  you  [Music]  you
 

